{"seq":31,"slug":"webgpu-graphics","title":"WebGPU 与图形编程","stage":"DONE","category":"frontend","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webgpu-graphics","rating":{"composite":3.79,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"webgpu-与图形编程\">WebGPU 与图形编程</h1><p>2026 年是 WebGPU 真正成为 Web 平台一等公民的一年：Chrome、Edge、Firefox 与 Safari 都已正式发布支持，浏览器覆盖率突破七成，开发者第一次可以面向全部主流用户直接交付 GPU 加速的图形与计算能力，而不必再为某个引擎缺席而保留 WebGL 回退分支。这个 hub 想回答的核心问题是：当一块现代 GPU 通过一套显式、底层、可预测的 API 暴露给 JavaScript 时，作为一名有几年经验的工程师，你该如何理解它、驱动它、并把它用在真实项目里。</p>\n<p>整个 hub 由四章组成，刻意按「从地基到落地」的顺序层层递进，每一章都建立在前一章之上。</p>\n<p>第一章「基础」回答「WebGPU 是什么、它如何看待 GPU」。我们先厘清 WebGPU 在 Web 图形史中的定位与它相对 WebGL 的根本不同，再建立一套贯穿全书的 GPU 管线心智模型，最后讲清楚一切的入口——适配器与设备的获取、能力协商与错误处理。没有这一章的心智模型，后面所有 API 调用都会像是在背咒语。</p>\n<p>第二章「渲染管线」把基础落到「画出第一个三角形」这条主线上。数据如何进入 GPU（缓冲区与绑定组）、运行在 GPU 上的程序如何写（WGSL 着色器）、以及如何把这些零件组装成一条可绘制的渲染管线并提交绘制命令。三篇文档对应渲染路径的三个关键环节，缺一不可。</p>\n<p>第三章「计算」转向 WebGPU 区别于 WebGL 的杀手锏：通用计算。从计算着色器的工作组模型，到归约、扫描、排序这些可复用的 GPGPU 模式，再到支撑这一切的数据并行原理（SIMT、subgroup、占用率与内存层次）。这一章解释了为什么浏览器里也能跑得动机器学习推理与物理模拟。</p>\n<p>第四章「工程实践」负责收口落地：如何度量并优化性能、如何理性地在 WebGL 与 WebGPU 之间做技术选型、以及 2026 年以 Three.js、TSL、Babylon.js 为核心的库与生态长什么样。它把前三章的原理翻译成可以写进生产代码评审清单的判断。</p>\n<p>四条主线——心智模型、渲染、计算、工程——并非并列，而是依赖关系：理解了管线才看得懂渲染，理解了渲染才能对照出计算的特殊性，理解了三者才能在工程上做出有依据的取舍。建议顺序阅读；若你已有 WebGL 背景，可先看第一章与第四章的对比篇建立坐标，再回头补齐渲染与计算的细节。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webgpu-graphics/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"webgpu-overview","title":"WebGPU 概览与定位","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webgpu-graphics/foundations/webgpu-overview"},{"seq":2,"slug":"gpu-pipeline-model","title":"GPU 管线模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webgpu-graphics/foundations/gpu-pipeline-model"},{"seq":3,"slug":"device-adapter","title":"适配器与设备","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webgpu-graphics/foundations/device-adapter"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"rendering","title":"渲染管线","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webgpu-graphics/rendering","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"buffers-bindings","title":"缓冲区与绑定组","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webgpu-graphics/rendering/buffers-bindings"},{"seq":2,"slug":"shaders-wgsl","title":"着色器与 WGSL","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webgpu-graphics/rendering/shaders-wgsl"},{"seq":3,"slug":"render-pipeline","title":"渲染管线与绘制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webgpu-graphics/rendering/render-pipeline"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"compute","title":"计算","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webgpu-graphics/compute","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"compute-shaders","title":"计算着色器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webgpu-graphics/compute/compute-shaders"},{"seq":2,"slug":"gpgpu-patterns","title":"GPGPU 模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webgpu-graphics/compute/gpgpu-patterns"},{"seq":3,"slug":"data-parallelism","title":"数据并行","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webgpu-graphics/compute/data-parallelism"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"工程实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webgpu-graphics/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"performance-optimization","title":"性能优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webgpu-graphics/practice/performance-optimization"},{"seq":2,"slug":"webgl-vs-webgpu","title":"WebGL 对比 WebGPU","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webgpu-graphics/practice/webgl-vs-webgpu"},{"seq":3,"slug":"libraries-ecosystem","title":"库与生态","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/webgpu-graphics/practice/libraries-ecosystem"}]}]}